⚠️ AUDIO FILE REQUIRED

This is a placeholder file. You need to add a real MP3 audio file named:
beat-loop-1.mp3

See assets/audio/README.md for instructions on how to get audio files.

Quick solution:
1. Go to https://pixabay.com/music/
2. Search "drum loop" or "metronome"
3. Download a free MP3
4. Rename it to "beat-loop-1.mp3"
5. Replace this placeholder file

The app will NOT work without a real audio file!
